  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Validation of cold treatment of FCM flower export</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims for a good set-up for technical research needed to prove the effectiveness of the method to eradicate the false codling moth (FCM), to prove the method eventually as a phytosanitary measure and to get sector-wide support for this cold treatment and eradicate the harmful FCM on flower exports.</narrative>
  </description>
